('ian-marder','es','Un investigador en criminología que escribe sobre justicia restaurativa, policía y colaboraciones de investigación. Su perfil de Maynooth University reúne publicaciones y actividad investigadora.','Criminology researcher writing about restorative justice, policing and research partnerships. His Maynooth University profile brings together publications and research activity.'),
