('tom-kirchmaier','es','Artículos de investigación y resúmenes no técnicos sobre policía y delincuencia, incluidos tiempos de respuesta, organización policial y violencia doméstica. Los enlaces llevan a publicaciones y documentos de trabajo.','Research papers and non-technical summaries on policing and crime, including response times, police organisation and domestic abuse. Links connect readers to published work and discussion papers.'),
('ben-bradford','fr','Des commentaires publics d’un chercheur sur la confiance, la légitimité et les pressions sur la police, rassemblés sur sa page d’auteur de Political Quarterly. À lire en parallèle des études originales discutées.','Public commentary by a policing researcher on trust, legitimacy and the pressures facing policing, collected on the Political Quarterly author page. Commentary should be read alongside the original studies it discusses.'),
('ben-bradford','es','Comentarios públicos de un investigador policial sobre confianza, legitimidad y presiones sobre la policía, reunidos en su página de autor de Political Quarterly. Deben leerse junto con los estudios originales comentados.','Public commentary by a policing researcher on trust, legitimacy and the pressures facing policing, collected on the Political Quarterly author page. Commentary should be read alongside the original studies it discusses.'),
('uchile-cesc','fr','Publications universitaires sur la sécurité citoyenne, la police, la prévention des violences et l’évaluation des programmes en Amérique latine. La collection comprend des travaux sur les perceptions de la police et des exemples de pratiques évaluées.','University publications on citizen security, policing, violence prevention and programme evaluation in Latin America. The collection includes work on public perceptions of police and evaluated practice examples.'),
('uchile-cesc','es','Publicaciones universitarias sobre seguridad ciudadana, policía, prevención de las violencias y evaluación de programas en América Latina. La colección incluye estudios sobre percepciones de la policía y ejemplos de prácticas evaluadas.','University publications on citizen security, policing, violence prevention and programme evaluation in Latin America. The collection includes work on public perceptions of police and evaluated practice examples.'),
('usp-nev','fr','Collection de recherches universitaires sur la violence, la légitimité de la police, les droits et la justice pénale au Brésil. Des résumés en portugais côtoient certaines notices d’articles en anglais et des liens vers les publications.','University research collection on violence, police legitimacy, rights and criminal justice in Brazil. Portuguese publication summaries sit alongside some English-language article information and links to published research.'),
('usp-nev','es','Colección universitaria sobre violencia, legitimidad policial, derechos y justicia penal en Brasil. Incluye resúmenes en portugués, información de algunos artículos en inglés y enlaces a las investigaciones publicadas.','University research collection on violence, police legitimacy, rights and criminal justice in Brazil. Portuguese publication summaries sit alongside some English-language article information and links to published research.'),
('cleen-foundation','fr','Recherches et publications pratiques d’une organisation de la société civile nigériane sur la réforme de la police, la responsabilité, la sécurité publique et la justice. La collection réunit enquêtes, audits, supports de formation et rapports institutionnels.','Nigerian civil-society research and practical publications on police reform, accountability, public safety and justice. Its books collection includes surveys, reform audits and training resources, alongside organisational reports.'),
('cleen-foundation','es','Investigaciones y publicaciones prácticas de una organización de la sociedad civil nigeriana sobre reforma policial, rendición de cuentas, seguridad pública y justicia. La colección incluye encuestas, auditorías, recursos formativos e informes institucionales.','Nigerian civil-society research and practical publications on police reform, accountability, public safety and justice. Its books collection includes surveys, reform audits and training resources, alongside organisational reports.'),
('korea-police-science','fr','Rapports d’une université de police sur la justice procédurale, la légitimité, les organisations policières, la criminalité et la technologie. Le catalogue coréen présente des notices et pièces jointes ; cet institut est distinct du KICJ.','Police university research reports on procedural justice, police legitimacy, organisational characteristics, crime and technology. The Korean-language catalogue provides report records and attachments; it is distinct from the Korean Institute of Criminology and Justice.'),
('korea-police-science','es','Informes de una universidad policial sobre justicia procedimental, legitimidad, características organizativas, delincuencia y tecnología. El catálogo en coreano ofrece registros y archivos adjuntos; este instituto es distinto del KICJ.','Police university research reports on procedural justice, police legitimacy, organisational characteristics, crime and technology. The Korean-language catalogue provides report records and attachments; it is distinct from the Korean Institute of Criminology and Justice.'),
('taiwan-cpu-publications','fr','Portail universitaire vers des périodiques d’études policières, un répertoire documentaire, des thèses et des revues de sciences forensiques. Il distingue la recherche de publications d’un service de ressources électroniques réservé aux personnels et étudiants.','University publication gateway linking police studies periodicals, a police knowledge repository, theses and forensic science journals. It distinguishes publication searches from an electronic-resource service restricted to university staff and students.'),
('taiwan-cpu-publications','es','Portal universitario con acceso a publicaciones de estudios policiales, un repositorio, tesis y revistas de ciencias forenses. Distingue las búsquedas de publicaciones de un servicio electrónico restringido al personal y alumnado.','University publication gateway linking police studies periodicals, a police knowledge repository, theses and forensic science journals. It distinguishes publication searches from an electronic-resource service restricted to university staff and students.'),
('laspad-hira','fr','Recherches universitaires sur l’accompagnement des filles et femmes victimes de violences sexuelles et sexistes au Sénégal. Les ressources publiques comprennent un modèle de prise en charge, une cartographie de l’hébergement et un annuaire de centres.','University research on support for girls and women affected by sexual and gender-based violence in Senegal. Public resources include a service model, accommodation mapping and a directory of support centres.'),
('laspad-hira','es','Investigación universitaria sobre apoyo a niñas y mujeres afectadas por violencia sexual y de género en Senegal. Sus recursos públicos incluyen un modelo de atención, un mapa de alojamientos y un directorio de centros.','University research on support for girls and women affected by sexual and gender-based violence in Senegal. Public resources include a service model, accommodation mapping and a directory of support centres.'),
('inacipe-journal','fr','Revue de l’Institut national des sciences pénales du Mexique. Elle publie recherches et analyses sur la criminalité, la victimologie, les politiques pénales, les sciences forensiques et la justice ; les analyses juridiques relèvent des juridictions étudiées.','Criminal sciences journal from Mexico’s National Institute of Criminal Sciences. It publishes research and analysis on crime, victimology, criminal policy, forensic sciences and justice; legal discussions concern their stated jurisdictions.'),
('inacipe-journal','es','Revista del Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Penales de México. Publica investigación y análisis sobre delincuencia, victimología, política criminal, ciencias forenses y justicia; sus análisis jurídicos corresponden a las jurisdicciones que estudian.','Criminal sciences journal from Mexico’s National Institute of Criminal Sciences. It publishes research and analysis on crime, victimology, criminal policy, forensic sciences and justice; legal discussions concern their stated jurisdictions.'),
('flacso-urvio','fr','Revue de FLACSO Équateur sur la sécurité citoyenne, la police, la violence et la criminalité en Amérique latine. Ses archives réunissent recherches et analyses des politiques de prévention et de sécurité, au-delà des seules interventions évaluées.','FLACSO Ecuador journal covering citizen security, policing, violence and crime in Latin America. Its archive includes research articles and discussions of prevention and security policy, rather than only evaluated interventions.'),
('flacso-urvio','es','Revista de FLACSO Ecuador sobre seguridad ciudadana, policía, violencia y delincuencia en América Latina. Su archivo incluye investigaciones y debates sobre prevención y políticas de seguridad, además de intervenciones evaluadas.','FLACSO Ecuador journal covering citizen security, policing, violence and crime in Latin America. Its archive includes research articles and discussions of prevention and security policy, rather than only evaluated interventions.'),
('delito-sociedad','fr','Revue universitaire argentine sur la criminalité, la police, la justice pénale et le contrôle social. Des annonces universitaires et notices institutionnelles renvoient à des recherches sur la police de proximité, les organisations et les pratiques judiciaires.','Argentine university journal on crime, policing, criminal justice and social control. Public university notices and institutional article records link research on community policing, police organisations and criminal justice practices.'),
('delito-sociedad','es','Revista universitaria argentina sobre delito, policía, justicia penal y control social. Los avisos universitarios y registros institucionales enlazan investigaciones sobre policía comunitaria, organizaciones policiales y prácticas de justicia penal.','Argentine university journal on crime, policing, criminal justice and social control. Public university notices and institutional article records link research on community policing, police organisations and criminal justice practices.'),
('met-research','fr','Évaluations publiées par la Strategic Insight Unit de la police londonienne, notamment sur la supervision des caméras-piétons et la formation à la justice procédurale. La collection présente les méthodes, résultats et limites et renvoie aux rapports.','Published evaluations from the Met’s Strategic Insight Unit, including supervisor reviews of body-worn video and procedural justice training. The collection explains methods, findings and limitations, with links to the underlying reports.'),
('met-research','es','Evaluaciones publicadas por la Strategic Insight Unit de la policía londinense, sobre supervisión de cámaras corporales y formación en justicia procedimental. La colección explica métodos, resultados y limitaciones y enlaza los informes.','Published evaluations from the Met’s Strategic Insight Unit, including supervisor reviews of body-worn video and procedural justice training. The collection explains methods, findings and limitations, with links to the underlying reports.'),
('hampshire-vrp-evaluations','fr','Évaluations locales commandées par le partenariat de réduction de la violence : pratiques policières tenant compte des traumatismes, accompagnement en garde à vue et à l’hôpital, dissuasion ciblée et soutien aux jeunes. Chaque programme nécessite une appréciation distincte.','Local evaluations commissioned through the violence reduction partnership, covering trauma-informed policing, custody and hospital navigators, focused deterrence and support for young people. Reports concern different programmes and should be assessed separately.'),
('hampshire-vrp-evaluations','es','Evaluaciones locales encargadas por la alianza para reducir la violencia: policía informada por el trauma, acompañamiento en custodia y hospitales, disuasión focalizada y apoyo juvenil. Cada programa requiere una valoración independiente.','Local evaluations commissioned through the violence reduction partnership, covering trauma-informed policing, custody and hospital navigators, focused deterrence and support for young people. Reports concern different programmes and should be assessed separately.'),
('kent-medway-vru','fr','Collection locale de rapports sur la réduction de la violence, d’analyses des besoins et d’une évaluation externe de Cordis Bright. Les données sur les besoins locaux et la mise en œuvre côtoient les bilans annuels ; leur portée probante diffère.','A local collection of violence reduction reports, strategic needs assessments and an external evaluation by Cordis Bright. It provides evidence about local needs and delivery alongside annual activity reports; these are different forms of evidence.'),
('kent-medway-vru','es','Colección local de informes sobre reducción de la violencia, análisis de necesidades y una evaluación externa de Cordis Bright. Reúne evidencia sobre necesidades y ejecución junto con memorias anuales; son tipos de evidencia distintos.','A local collection of violence reduction reports, strategic needs assessments and an external evaluation by Cordis Bright. It provides evidence about local needs and delivery alongside annual activity reports; these are different forms of evidence.'),
('n8-policing','fr','Collaboration entre police et universités publiant des rapports, des synthèses Agile Evidence Reviews et des textes de chercheurs et praticiens. Les thèmes comprennent la vulnérabilité, la garde à vue, la culture policière et les violences domestiques. Chaque étude conserve ses propres limites.','Police–university collaboration publishing research reports, Agile Evidence Reviews and accessible writing by researchers and practitioners. Topics include vulnerability, custody, police culture, domestic abuse and changing demand. Reviews and individual studies retain their own scope and limitations.'),
('n8-policing','es','Colaboración entre policía y universidades que publica informes, revisiones Agile Evidence Reviews y textos de investigadores y profesionales. Incluye vulnerabilidad, custodia, cultura policial y violencia doméstica. Cada revisión y estudio conserva su propio alcance y limitaciones.','Police–university collaboration publishing research reports, Agile Evidence Reviews and accessible writing by researchers and practitioners. Topics include vulnerability, custody, police culture, domestic abuse and changing demand. Reviews and individual studies retain their own scope and limitations.'),
('icpr-policing','fr','Recherches universitaires et publications sur les organisations policières, leur efficacité et leurs relations avec le public. Les projets portent sur la justice procédurale, les plaintes, la fraude, la professionnalisation et l’usage des preuves, avec des liens vers les travaux.','University research and publications on policing organisations, effectiveness and relationships with the public. Projects cover procedural justice, police complaints, fraud, professionalisation and the use of evidence, with links to papers and working reports.'),
('icpr-policing','es','Investigación universitaria y publicaciones sobre organizaciones policiales, eficacia y relaciones con la ciudadanía. Los proyectos abarcan justicia procedimental, quejas, fraude, profesionalización y uso de evidencia, con enlaces a artículos e informes.','University research and publications on policing organisations, effectiveness and relationships with the public. Projects cover procedural justice, police complaints, fraud, professionalisation and the use of evidence, with links to papers and working reports.'),
('bsc-policing-blog','fr','Contributions accessibles de chercheurs, dont des doctorants, présentant leurs travaux et discutant des pratiques. Les billets traitent de culture policière, bien-être, décision, prévention de la violence et réformes. Certaines contributions exposent des résultats préliminaires ou des interprétations personnelles.','Accessible contributions by policing researchers, including doctoral researchers, explaining their studies and debating practice. Posts link to research on police culture, wellbeing, decision-making, violence prevention and reform. Some contributions report preliminary findings or personal interpretation.'),
('bsc-policing-blog','es','Textos accesibles de investigadores, incluidos doctorandos, que explican sus estudios y debaten la práctica. Tratan cultura policial, bienestar, decisiones, prevención de la violencia y reformas. Algunas contribuciones presentan resultados preliminares o interpretaciones personales.','Accessible contributions by policing researchers, including doctoral researchers, explaining their studies and debating practice. Posts link to research on police culture, wellbeing, decision-making, violence prevention and reform. Some contributions report preliminary findings or personal interpretation.'),
('politieacademie-research','fr','Recherches en néerlandais, liens vers des publications, podcasts et connaissances pratiques de l’Académie de police. Ses centres couvrent police locale, enquêtes, technologies numériques et organisation. Les pages publiques renvoient à la bibliothèque policière ; l’accès varie selon les services.','Dutch-language police research, publication links, podcasts and practical knowledge from the Police Academy. Its centres cover local policing, investigation, digital technology and police organisations. The public research pages link to the police library; access to individual services varies.'),
('politieacademie-research','es','Investigación en neerlandés, enlaces a publicaciones, pódcast y conocimiento práctico de la Academia de Policía. Sus centros abarcan policía local, investigación, tecnología digital y organizaciones policiales. Las páginas públicas enlazan la biblioteca policial; el acceso varía según el servicio.','Dutch-language police research, publication links, podcasts and practical knowledge from the Police Academy. Its centres cover local policing, investigation, digital technology and police organisations. The public research pages link to the police library; access to individual services varies.'),
('gruene-liste-praevention','fr','Registre en allemand de programmes de prévention destinés aux enfants, jeunes, familles et collectivités. Les notices distinguent les niveaux de preuve et la qualité de mise en œuvre. Son champ inclut prévention et promotion de la santé, au-delà des seules interventions policières.','German-language evidence register of prevention programmes for children, young people, families and communities. Entries distinguish levels of evaluation evidence and implementation quality. It covers wider prevention and health promotion as well as violence, rather than police interventions alone.'),
('gruene-liste-praevention','es','Registro en alemán de programas preventivos para menores, jóvenes, familias y comunidades. Las fichas distinguen niveles de evidencia y calidad de implementación. Abarca prevención y promoción de la salud, además de violencia, y no solo intervenciones policiales.','German-language evidence register of prevention programmes for children, young people, families and communities. Entries distinguish levels of evaluation evidence and implementation quality. It covers wider prevention and health promotion as well as violence, rather than police interventions alone.'),
('jeff-asher','fr','Newsletter et podcast Substack consacrés aux données criminelles et à la mesure de leurs tendances, avec des entretiens de criminologues et chercheurs en police. Principalement américain, ce contenu analytique doit être distingué des évaluations d’interventions policières.','A named Substack newsletter and podcast analysing crime data and how crime trends are measured, with interviews with criminologists and policing researchers. Its focus is mainly American; data commentary and interviews should be distinguished from evaluated policing interventions.'),
('jeff-asher','es','Boletín y pódcast de Substack sobre datos delictivos y medición de tendencias, con entrevistas a criminólogos e investigadores policiales. Su enfoque es principalmente estadounidense; el análisis de datos y las entrevistas se distinguen de las evaluaciones de intervenciones.','A named Substack newsletter and podcast analysing crime data and how crime trends are measured, with interviews with criminologists and policing researchers. Its focus is mainly American; data commentary and interviews should be distinguished from evaluated policing interventions.'),
('john-shjarback','fr','Textes publics d’un chercheur en police reliant les études aux débats sur les pratiques, la police de proximité et les réponses en santé mentale. Les billets citent les recherches ; son site principal propose aussi rapports, évaluations et matériel de réplication.','Public writing by a policing researcher, connecting studies with debates about police practice, community policing and mental health responses. Named posts discuss evidence and link to research; the author’s main website also provides reports, evaluations and replication materials.'),
('john-shjarback','es','Textos públicos de un investigador policial que conectan estudios con debates sobre práctica, policía comunitaria y respuestas en salud mental. Las publicaciones enlazan investigaciones; su web principal también ofrece informes, evaluaciones y materiales de replicación.','Public writing by a policing researcher, connecting studies with debates about police practice, community policing and mental health responses. Named posts discuss evidence and link to research; the author’s main website also provides reports, evaluations and replication materials.'),
('matt-ashby','fr','Analyses de données, graphiques et explications d’un chercheur en sciences du crime, accompagnés d’une collection de publications et de versions accessibles lorsqu’elles existent. Thèmes : homicides, concentration du crime, demande policière et lecture des tendances, avec des tutoriels de recherche.','Public data analysis, charts and explanations by a crime science researcher, with a linked publication collection and free-to-read versions where available. Topics include homicide, crime concentration, police demand and interpreting trends, alongside practical research and data tutorials.'),
('matt-ashby','es','Análisis de datos, gráficos y explicaciones de un investigador de ciencia del delito, con una colección de publicaciones y versiones gratuitas cuando están disponibles. Incluye homicidio, concentración delictiva, demanda policial e interpretación de tendencias, además de tutoriales.','Public data analysis, charts and explanations by a crime science researcher, with a linked publication collection and free-to-read versions where available. Topics include homicide, crime concentration, police demand and interpreting trends, alongside practical research and data tutorials.'),
('bit-crime-justice','fr','Rapports et contributions publiques appliquant les sciences comportementales à la criminalité, à la justice et à la police : réduction de la violence, participation des victimes et équipes analytiques policières. Les archives Medium Behavioural Insights proposent d’autres textes. Rapports et commentaires nécessitent une appréciation distincte.','Research reports and public writing applying behavioural science to crime, justice and policing, including violence reduction, victim participation and work with police analytical teams. The named Behavioural Insights Medium archive provides further writing; reports and commentary require separate appraisal.'),
('bit-crime-justice','es','Informes y divulgación que aplican ciencia conductual a delincuencia, justicia y policía: reducción de violencia, participación de víctimas y equipos analíticos policiales. El archivo identificado Behavioural Insights en Medium ofrece otros textos. Informes y comentarios requieren valoraciones separadas.','Research reports and public writing applying behavioural science to crime, justice and policing, including violence reduction, victim participation and work with police analytical teams. The named Behavioural Insights Medium archive provides further writing; reports and commentary require separate appraisal.')
) as t(slug,locale,about,original_about) join public.sources s on s.slug=t.slug and s.about=t.original_about
on conflict(source_id,locale) do nothing;
